  "decisions": [
    "Switch the OAuth engine from go-oauth2 to Fosite behind the existing LeafWiki OAuth/MCP route contract.",
    "Do not add, remove, or expose user-facing OAuth capabilities in the first cut.",
    "Add only internal Fosite support needed for current behavior: narrow handler composition, in-memory Fosite storage, internal bearer verification, and revocation state required for refresh/code correctness.",
